#
# The only graph data this manifest uses (`dataDrivenCall` and
# `modeRestrictedReorder` both read it): the two people whose basic graph pattern
# drives a call. `:brian` is deliberately absent, so the driving bag is a strict
# subset of the relation's subject column and the answer shows the call was invoked
# per driving row rather than enumerated whole — and, for the reordered case, that
# the row source the feasibility pass moved ahead of the call is this one.
@prefix : <http://purrdf.test/relations#> .

:ada :status :active .
:chen :status :active .
